    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_01",
      "hash64": "31D7E21AA8308EA7",
      "text": "Pfiou ! Ça y est, j’peux souffler et reparler\\nnormalement ![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_02",
      "hash64": "31D7E31AA830905A",
      "text": "L’oral est enfin bouclé ![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_03",
      "hash64": "31D7E41AA830920D",
      "text": "Et vu tes résultats, on peut dire que t’as assuré ![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_04",
      "hash64": "31D7DD1AA8308628",
      "text": "T’as réussi la première épreuve de l’exam ![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_05a",
      "hash64": "E256214BCA76A10E",
      "text": "Du premier coup, en plus !\\nJ’crois que c’est pas arrivé depuis Menzi.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_05b",
      "hash64": "E256204BCA769F5B",
      "text": "J’pensais que t’allais réussir du premier coup,\\npar contre...[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_06",
      "hash64": "31D7DF1AA830898E",
      "text": "Bon, maintenant, faut passer à la suite ![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_07",
      "hash64": "31D7E01AA8308B41",
      "text": "Pour ta deuxième épreuve, tu dois battre\\nles membres du Conseil 4...[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_08",
      "hash64": "31D7D91AA8307F5C",
      "text": "C’est ce qu’on appelle l’épreuve pratique ![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_09",
      "hash64": "31D7DA1AA830810F",
      "text": "Ouais, le nom vend pas du rêve, j’te l’accorde...[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_10",
      "hash64": "31DAE71AA832CCFD",
      "text": "En gros, tu vas affronter les quatre Dresseurs\\ndu conseil à la suite.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_11",
      "hash64": "31DAE61AA832CB4A",
      "text": "Mais j’te préviens, ça va pas être de la tarte.\\nPrépare-toi bien ! Quand tu l’sens, va dans\\r\\nla pièce du fond.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_12",
      "hash64": "31DAE51AA832C997",
      "text": "Quand tu s’ras prêt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e pour l’épreuve pratique,\\nva dans la pièce du fond.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 3,
